  <para style="p"> <verse style="v" number="5" /><char style="w" strong="G3756">vvv</char> <char style="w" strong="G3421">Do you not remember</char> <char style="w" strong="G3754">that</char> <char style="w" strong="G2036">I told</char> <char style="w" strong="G4771">you</char> <char style="w" strong="G3778">these things</char> <char style="w" strong="G1510">while I was</char> <char style="w" strong="G2089">still</char> <char style="w" strong="G4314">with</char> <char style="w" strong="G4771">you</char>? <verse style="v" number="6" /><char style="w" strong="G2532">And</char> <char style="w" strong="G1492">you know</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">what</char> <char style="w" strong="G3568">vvv</char> <char style="w" strong="G2722">is now restraining [him]</char>, <char style="w" strong="G1519">so that</char> <char style="w" strong="G846">he</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G601">may be revealed</char> <char style="w" strong="G1722">at</char> <char style="w" strong="G1438">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">the</char> <char style="w" strong="G2540">proper time</char>. <verse style="v" number="7" /><char style="w" strong="G1063">For</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">the</char> <char style="w" strong="G3466">mystery</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G458">of lawlessness</char> <char style="w" strong="G2235">{is} already</char> <char style="w" strong="G1754">at work</char>, <char style="w" strong="G3440">but</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">the [one who]</char> <char style="w" strong="G737">now</char> <char style="w" strong="G2722">restrains [it]</char> <char style="w" strong="G2193">[will continue] until</char> <char style="w" strong="G1096">he is taken</char> <char style="w" strong="G1537">out of</char> <char style="w" strong="G3319">[the] way</char>. <verse style="v" number="8" /><char style="w" strong="G2532">And</char> <char style="w" strong="G5119">then</char> <char style=